You're Welcome, Mankind.

3
00:00:06,274 --> 00:00:10,194
(Sheldon:)All right, then. Just shout when you hear
the task you want to undertake.

4
00:00:10,361 --> 00:00:12,401
(Sheldon:)Uh, dentist.

5
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:18,743
(Sheldon:)Okay, we can circle back
to that one. Um...

6
00:00:18,995 --> 00:00:23,415
(Sheldon:)Who wants to take me Wednesday morning
to get new heels put on my dress shoes?

7
00:00:27,503 --> 00:00:28,793
(Sheldon:)Anyone? Oh.

8
00:00:28,963 --> 00:00:30,713
That one had "hoot" written all over it.

9
00:00:30,882 --> 00:00:33,972
(Sheldon:)Um, all right. Uh, dermatologist.

10
