(Sheldon:)Supercuts?

13
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:46,480
(Sheldon:)Okay, okay, here's a fun one.

14
00:00:46,647 --> 00:00:51,777
(Sheldon:)Um, I need a new picture frame and
